ations. The straw façade shows no signs of Surface condensation since the interior surface temperature factor of the façade is 0.927, higher than the required by the conditions of the most restrictive month (0.430). Also, there is no risk of interstitial condensations in any month. These results indicate that the rice straw panels can be both a suitable sustainable alternative for the building industry in Spain and a viable solution to the environmental problems caused by rice straw mismanagement. © 2021"
        
